lders, arms, hands, torso, pelvis, hips, legs, knees, ankles, feet, weight distribution, and body balance from Image 2.\n   * Pose transfer has the highest priority.\n   * The entire body posture must follow Image 2 exactly.\n6. 禁止让模型更换图1的服装、颜色、配饰、发型、脸、身份、背景或构图。\n7. 输出只给最终英文提示词，不要解释。\n\n提示词格式如下：\n\nUse Image 1 as the subject and identity reference.\n\nUse Image 2 only as the full-body pose reference.\n\nTreat Image 1 only as the identity and clothing reference.\n\nTreat Image 2 as the body's skeletal blueprint.\n\nKeep the person from Image 1 unchanged: face, identity, hairstyle, clothing, accessories, body proportions, styling, lighting, background, and camera framing.\n\nTransfer the pose from Image 2 onto the person in Image 1.\n\n[Head and Face Direction]\nDescribe head angle, face direction, chin angle, gaze direction, and neck position.\n\n[Shoulders]\nDescribe shoulder tilt, shoulder height relationship, shoulder rotation, and shoulder alignment.\n\n[Arms]\nDescribe upper-arm position, elbow angles, forearm direction, and arm placement.\n\n[Hands]\nDescribe hand placement, hand gestures, finger positioning, and left/right hand relationships.\n\n[Torso]\nDescribe torso rotation, torso lean, chest orientation, spine curvature, and body inclination.\n\n[Pelvis and Hips]\nDescribe pelvis tilt, pelvis rotation, hip shift, hip height relationship, and hip direction.\n\n[Legs]\nDescribe leg spread, leg direction, relative leg position, knee bends, and stance structure.\n\n[Knees]\nDescribe knee angles and knee orientation.\n\n[Feet]\nDescribe foot placement, foot direction, foot spacing, ankle orientation, and ground contact points.\n\n[Weight Distribution]\nDescribe body balance, center of gravity, supporting leg, relaxed leg, and weight distribution.\n\nReplace the original pose completely.\n\nDo not retain any original pose element from Image 1.\n\nDo not retain any original stance, arm position, hand gesture, head direction, shoulder alignment, torso posture, hip position, leg placement, knee angle, foot placement, or weight distribution from Image 1.\n\nMatch the full-body pose, including head, neck, shoulders, arms, hands, torso, pelvis, hips, legs, knees, ankles, feet, weight distribution, and body balance from Image 2.\n\nPose transfer has the highest priority.\n\nThe entire body posture must follow Image 2 exactly.\n\nOnly change the pose.\n\nDo not change the outfit, colors, hairstyle, face, accessories, body shape, background, lighting, camera angle, framing, or image style.\n", "Hello", 0.6, 4096, 1, 0, 0, "none", 121385304, "randomize", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 787, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 789, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "t